#. [unit_type]: id=Deep Bomber, race=deep, gender=female
#: Deep/units/Bomber.cfg:4
msgid "Deep Bomber"
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type]: id=Deep Bomber, race=deep, gender=female
#: Deep/units/Bomber.cfg:20
msgid "Deep bombers are involved in more serious conflicts than simple defense of their colony and as such, they have upgraded their equipment, flying and throwing techniques. In addition to the classic rocks, they also use lighter, flaming projectiles, that earned them their current name."
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type]: id=Deep Captivator, race=deep, gender=female
#: Deep/units/Captivator.cfg:4
msgid "Deep Captivator"
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type]: id=Deep Captivator, race=deep, gender=female
#: Deep/units/Captivator.cfg:20
msgid ""
"The voice of the most famous deep minstrels is said to be able to both break and mend hearts. People usually regard these stories as mere legends, but some of them suspect there is magic at work. The captivator's first aim is precisely to avoid that people think this.\n"
"They weave magic within their melodies, warping others' perception of the world and disguising their looks to better charm them. When their power is strong enough, their illusions start to occur from nearly inaudible sounds like low humming or breathing, allowing them to change how they look to please their audience."
msgstr ""

