#. [unit_type]: id=Deep Siren, race=deep, gender=female
#: Deep/units/Siren.cfg:21
msgid "Deep have a strong belief that their kind was born from a magical song, sung from what they call the World of Mist. When the wind song feels sorrowful, it is because we hear the laments of beings that got lost in that illusory land."
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type]: id=Deep Songstress of Storms, race=deep, gender=female
