msgid "Songstress of Storms"
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type]: id=Deep Songstress of Storms, race=deep, gender=female
#: Deep/units/Songstressofstorms.cfg:20
msgid "Some deep singers chose to live away from land, secluded in places where they can become one with the wind. They spend days meditating at sea to listen to the song of the gales. When their kin calls for help however, their mastery of weather lets them summon fierce storms that scatter enemy troops. "
msgstr ""

