msgid ""
"The owl Deep' unparalleled stealth makes them a great asset in wars and skirmishes, where they spy and strike in the midst of enemy lines.\n"
"As they tread further down this path of stalking and hunt, the wisps of magic they possess make them fade more and more within the darkness. "
msgstr ""

